# Git Blame Ignore Revisions
# This file contains the commit hashes of bulk code formatting commits (e.g. Spotless / ktlint)
# that should be ignored by git blame to preserve the original authorship history.
#
# Configure locally: git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# Configure globally: git config --global blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
